# Notebook AI / briefing display UX

## Bold / emphasis

- Never leave literal `**...**` as visible garbage in chat or briefing UI.
- Prefer **render** inline markdown (`**bold**`, `*italic*`) via `InlineMarkdown` / `splitInlineMarkdown` — do not strip paired markers into broken plain text.
- Briefing `normalize_briefing_prose` may keep paired `**...**` for the SPA to render; only strip **unpaired** leftovers and Wire metadata noise.

## Pipeline warnings

- Do **not** show user-facing alerts like `Cảnh báo pipeline … Không đọc được … (empty response)`.
- Filter empty-fetch / unreadable-URL warnings in API `warnings` + SPA (`filterUserFacingPipelineWarnings`). Still log server-side; answer from readable sources only.

## Simple chat fast path

- Short / single-source / keyword-like questions → one healthy cloud model, insights-tight context, skip race + Groq polish. Keep deep multi-source analysis on the full path.
- Social/chitchat (xin chào, cảm ơn, bạn là ai, ok/test, …) → Groq `openai/gpt-oss-20b` only via `/ai/notebook-chat/chitchat/` — no crawl, no digest, no “Đang suy nghĩ…”.
